  "description": "Fleeing back to Korea after catching her ex-fiancé cheating in their own bed, Geurim vows to swear off men. She is completely done making terrible romantic choices over and over. But what she didn’t expect was to see her brother’s best friend, Mo Taegyeong, moving in right across the hall. It’s not just that he’s hot; it’s the fact that she acted on impulse and had an insanely hot one-night stand with him right before flying home. She knows getting involved with him is a recipe for disaster. The problem? Taekyeong’s an absolute master kisser, and he has zero intention of letting her walk away this time.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
